        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/Hokkaido/_scene_snowcrane.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 6be2a9d6-8d18-444f-9efb-b8cef1ba8631).Image",
        "Description": "47! You&apos;ve somehow been transported to feudal Japan. We have traced the cause for this incident to five actors located at a hospital in modern-day Hokkaido. They have sent you back in time to end your career... early. We have found a way to bring you back temporarally, but to keep you in the present you must find a way to eliminate these people without changing your outfit and exiting through the machine the ICA built just for this. Be warned though, these people are hiding deep in the hospital.",
